@block libs.agents
purpose agent roles, agent loop, sandbox, tickets, routing
kind    leaf
thread  any
est     L
fn      run_ticket(id) -> Result<Outcome>
fn      design(idea) -> Result<Outcome>
fn      apply_edit(root, EditOp) -> Result<AppliedEdit>
fn      bench_run(BenchOptions, Config, progress) -> Result<BenchResult[]>
fn      run_target(Schema, Config, args) -> RunTarget
call    libs.llm:send
call    libs.runner:test
call    libs.index:view
call    libs.code:check_drift
call    libs.metrics:cost_usd
use     libs.core
inv     the orchestrator never receives source code
inv     a stopped agent is never retried or escalated; its ticket stays open
inv     a worker writes only impl/ and tests/unit/ of its own leaf, or the listed files of its imported block
inv     a worker keeps the public declarations of an imported block's headers unless its card changed
